type: software
title: "GitHub Data Collector"
abstract: >-
  An ETL system for collecting GitHub data on repositories, contributors, and
  organizations, deriving a country from the free-text location of accounts,
  and storing the results in a SQLite or MySQL database for downstream analysis.
